 del norte de Inglaterra para restaurar un antiguo mural oculto en una iglesia. Su presencia despierta el recelo del reverendo y de unos vecinos reacios a cambiar el orden establecido.","description":"Cinco siglos atrás, un mural fue creado en una iglesia rural al norte de Inglaterra, para ser luego cubierto bajo capas de pintura blanca. Tom Birkin, veterano de la Primera Guerra Mundial, llega al pequeño pueblo para restaurar el mural, en contra de los deseos del Reverendo y gran parte del pueblo, quienes lo ven como un intruso que llega para alterar el orden establecido.","duration":5893000,"originalContentDuration":5533000,"allotment":5893,"rating":"TP","featuredImage":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa3d123763ed26aa48a8413/screenshot16_9_1789120819970.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"genre":"Drama","type":"movie","seasonsNumbers":[],"stitched":{"path":"/stitch/hls/episode/6aa3d123763ed26aa48a8413/master.m3u8"},"covers":[{"aspectRatio":"347:500","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa3d123763ed26aa48a8413/poster_1789120819970.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=1000&q=75&w=694"},{"aspectRatio":"4:3","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa3d123763ed26aa48a8413/screenshot4_3_1789120819970.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=480&q=75&w=640"},{"aspectRatio":"16:9","url":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa3d123763ed26aa48a8413/screenshot16_9_1789120819970.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"}],"categories":[{"id":"62d949808f6f0d00079962aa"}],"poster16_9":{"path":"https://images.pluto.tv/episodes/6aa3d123763ed26aa48a8413/poster16_9_1789120819970.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=540&q=75&w=960"},"clip":{"actors":["Colin Firth","Jim Carter","Patrick Malahide","Kenneth Branagh","John Atkinson","Richard Vernon","Tim Barker","Vicki Arundale","Martin O'Neil","Natasha Richardson"],"directors":["Pat O'Connor"],"producers":["Kenith Trodd"],"originalReleaseDate":"1987-05-31T00:00:00Z"},"avail":{},"cc":true,"stream_url":"https://cfd-v4-servi